 "narrative": [
  "A grade point average of 2.0 or higher in the upper-division major program is required for graduation.",
  "Students must receive a grade of C– or better in any course to be counted toward fulfillment of the major requirements. In exceptional cases, students with a grade point average in the major of 2.5 or greater may petition to have one grade of D accepted.",
  "All courses (lower and upper division) required for the major must be taken for a letter grade.",
  "It is suggested that the integrating sequence ESYS 101, 102, and 103 should be completed by sophomore year, if possible.",
  "Other courses may be substituted by petition."
 ]
